{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_5_level_main_05-09_end",
  "groupId": "main_5",
  "stageId": "main_05-09",
  "title": "孽生惡物",
  "storyCode": "5-9",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a31505cd22a1bb5cfc30a684e7a020ed7e2949ceb1f3890a457143785d33438e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "咳......咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "不堪一擊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "這麼多同胞，居然全都被你擊潰了？我確實要重新評價一下你的實力，長官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "不，不夠。浮士德，給她點驚喜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "頂樓的，趴下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "整合運動的狙擊手......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（雖然已經做好了防範措施，但他的火力居然強到這種地步？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這不能救你的命。在他傷到我之前，你就會死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......等等。你是之前被近衛局抓獲的那個感染者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你們近衛局也讓他受了很多苦吧。雖然這和烏薩斯烙在我們身上的相比，根本不算什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "剛才他刻意沒有瞄準你，近衛局的長官。這算是我禮節性地回報你，饒你一次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "現在，就連近衛局裡也埋藏著不安的種子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "也正是你們的腐壞和大意，讓他有機會和我們裡應外合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......整合運動，你們對你們所在的這片大地一無所知。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "這句話有什麼深意嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你認為浮士德是你們整合運動營救的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "近衛局裡有許多感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "二十一個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你是不是覺得，至少有四個一定會是徹徹底底的整合運動？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "可是連他們四個也都是我安插的。他們在接應你之後，你是不是囚禁了其中一個？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "很高明，長官。她逃走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "所以現在你還意識不到自己的處境嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "是啊，我該意識到的。我的隊伍已經潰散，只剩下我任人宰割。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "近衛局內外遊蕩著缺乏戰力的士兵，我的同胞幾乎失去了抵抗能力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你是想這麼說嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "還算有些自知之明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "那麼——來，我的護衛們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "起來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "唔，唔唔，呃呃呃呃呃！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "他們身上的源石......在生長？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "那些源石會刺穿他們原本的身體結構，成為他們新的身軀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "看吧長官，看吧，這就是我的護衛，我不死的護衛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "text": "【嘶嚎】",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "還有，我的牧群，我的同胞......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "粉塵......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "同胞們需要治療。他們需要我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "法術？各小隊，當心！敵方指揮官釋放了法術，粉塵飄散的範圍非常大！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "放心，長官，你們不是我的同胞，這和你沒有關係。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "......啊，啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正口運動成貝",
      "text": "......呃，呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皜剜祈撠？？斤斤？伐",
      "text": "呃呃，呃呃呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "呃呃啊啊啊啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "每非其寺巢巢郡",
      "text": "......血！！血！！啊啊啊！！！啊！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "安靜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅非斯寺的群群",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "陳sir，不好了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "被擊倒的整合運動黏上粉塵後，身體產生了巨大的變化！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "他們重新加入了戰鬥，正在緩緩逼近陣線！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "究竟有多少整合運動產生了變化？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "全部！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "他們是我的牧群，也是我的手足。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "g7，g6。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的牧群",
      "text": "——呃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "他們不會倒下，因為我會治癒他們所有的傷痛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你像操作自己的手指一樣操作他們，他們只是你的傀儡，怎麼能叫做手足？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "在我看來兩者並無區別。為了理想，我們什麼都可以是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "如果你把這叫做理想的話。看來，我必須要解決掉的就只有你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "有目標，有幹勁。很有魅力，長官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "火力集中！快！目標敵方指揮官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "text": "（呻吟）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "但我的護衛不是常人能撼動的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "用肉體為指揮官擋住了爆炸......還毫髮無損？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "剛才的火力，差不多能炸穿一層城市防壁了啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "別白費力氣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "傷口會癒合，皮肉會硬化，生命會復歸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "這些人的武器根本沒法對抗我的護衛，畢竟他們只是我為長官你一個人準備的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "同胞們，起身。別讓任何人干擾我和長官之間的談話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "陳sir，整合運動正一波又一波地向我們湧來！常規手段沒法擊潰他們！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "可惡，難道他們感覺不到痛苦嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "其他小隊也遭遇了相同的狀況！徘徊在大樓外的整合運動也開始行動了，他們正衝向大樓，不斷地撞擊我們剛剛控制住的安全保衛設施！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "優先處理你們身邊的敵人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "給我滾開！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "陳sir，這些東西根本就沒有知覺，近衛局大樓也被徹底包圍了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "我們被迫進入了肉搏戰，沒法支援你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "照顧好你們自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "很壯觀吧？他們歷經了太多戰鬥，意識似乎有些不堪重負了，但他們的肉體依然健康強壯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "實力似乎能稍稍彌補一點決策上的失誤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "至少這樣我們就有時間慢慢解決我們之間的問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我想好好和你談談，長官，無關這場戰鬥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "沒必要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我會直接解決你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "很快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "但還不夠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "用劍鋒偏移了弩彈？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "預判得很準，黑髮小子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "嘁，先用狙擊阻撓我的行動，適時預測我的行動，然後填上肉盾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "抱歉，長官。我大致能估算到你基本上所有的路線，下一步不過是稍加封鎖就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "這樣一來，你是沒法靠近我的。至於尖銳的弩箭、易爆的弩彈、沉重的弩刺，你喜歡哪種？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "也許你準備得確實很周全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "只是，一個棋手規劃完了整個棋局，他就只能將對方當做異色的棋子而非奇兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "（等等，粉塵怎麼會黏在她身上......？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "（原來是這樣，是這樣呀。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我不會像你那樣紙上談兵，我只是有備而來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "棋盤不適用於我，小子。我不是誰的棋子，我是龍門的利刃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "勇敢和莽撞雖然接近，卻依然留有一線之隔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "或者，你是想使用自己的底牌了？我似乎還沒見你在戰鬥裡使用另一把劍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "那不是把裝飾品，對吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這把劍根本不是用來對付你這種人的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "無論如何，你們都不值得我拔出這把劍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "只是，你們確實該付出代價了，為了你們對龍門、對切爾諾伯格所有無辜者所做的一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "此時，此刻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "它是你的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我不需要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "就當成我暫時借給你的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你不害怕？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "害怕你會對我兵刃相向？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "不，我不怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "因為我沒那麼怕死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "這不是尋常的武器，你會慢慢理解它的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "平日裡勿要揮霍它的煞氣。斬龍之劍當有出鞘的價值。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "該向誰出劍，就由你自己選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（......竟然還在蟄伏。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（即使是這種時候也依然不肯出鞘嗎。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（但現在，赤霄，你必須飲血！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
